<Layout title="Terms — Rakhi Battle by BondBop" noindex>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 26 August 2026.</p>
    <p>Rakhi Battle is a BondBop game operated in India by Divya Pandey. Support: <a href="mailto:support@bondbop.com">support@bondbop.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>Entertainment only</h2>
    <p>Rakhi Battle is a humorous entertainment product. Its profile is inspired by established sibling-research dimensions, but eight playful questions are not a validated psychological assessment, diagnosis or factual judgment of a family relationship.</p>
    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Use nicknames and lawful, non-harmful content. Do not harass people, automate votes, probe private links, attack the service, or use it for wagering or cash competitions.</p>
    <h2>Purchases</h2>
    <p>Paid upgrades are one-time digital purchases linked to one battle and shared by both participants through that result link. Exact Answer Reveal is ₹49. The Rakhi Gift Pack is ₹99, or ₹50 after Reveal. Taxes, if applicable, are shown at checkout. See <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>, <a href="/shipping">Shipping</a>, <a href="/delivery">Digital Delivery</a> and <a href="/refund">Cancellation & Refunds</a>.</p>
    <h2>Availability</h2>
    <p>This is a time-limited festival experiment and may change or close. We do not guarantee uninterrupted availability, but we will not fabricate player counts, votes, leaderboards or testimonials.</p>
    <h2>Hall of Fame</h2>
    <p>Leaderboard participation is optional and requires consent from both players. Rankings use completed quiz scores; identical nicknames are distinguished by a unique battle code. We may remove abusive, misleading or inappropriate nicknames.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
